      "en": "Now Jacob saw that there was grain in Egypt, and Jacob said to his sons, “Why do you look at one another?”",
      "ko": "때에 야곱이 애굽에 곡식이 있음을 보고 아들들에게 이르되 너희는 어찌하여 서로 관망만 하느냐",
      "source_text_hash": "263156255e0f4fab3c7e2ed3b58f06d64560c7adc8be1dd4a0b49aab164c30d9",
      "translation_text_hash": "8ffd2d12ce31f4325117c3c56c5436620eeb8893b87d3d98b00c1cd5a9b08801",
