      "en": "Joseph was the governor over the land. It was he who sold to all the people of the land. Joseph’s brothers came, and bowed themselves down to him with their faces to the earth.",
      "ko": "때에 요셉이 나라의 총리로서 그 땅 모든 백성에게 팔더니 요셉의 형들이 와서 그 앞에서 땅에 엎드려 절하매",
      "source_text_hash": "5447f55f5d1b7905446c436a404dd055becec0e103b13ee5b1cc2a22c8c4f4d2",
      "translation_text_hash": "0bcc42824d0a38b0b66588eee35621f27eb7db9b3a627337ed8d380a1e293084",
